Output channels/claude-tricks/assets/ep09/probe2.mp4
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1350
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "screen -S ep09 bash -c 'cd ~/demo-project && claude'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Type "/model"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 8s
